WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.840
Line graphs are good for showing changes over ordered time; category comparisons

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.387
often use bar graphs.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:12.036
Choose a suitable graph for temperature changes hour by hour. The answer is line

00:00:12.036 --> 00:00:16.181
graph. A line graph is suitable for temperature changes hour by hour.

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:22.202
A teacher at a farm collects data about favourite fruit categories. Which type of

00:00:22.202 --> 00:00:25.524
graph best communicates this? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:31.351
A teacher at a farm collects data about favourite fruit categories. Which type of

00:00:31.351 --> 00:00:36.691
graph best communicates this? The answer is bar graph. A bar graph is suitable for

00:00:36.691 --> 00:00:37.759
favourite fruit categories.
